---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="PickLoot's affiliate and advertising disclosure."
>
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last updated: [update this date when you publish]</p>

    <p>
      PickLoot is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program,
      an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to
      earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com and
      affiliated sites.
    </p>
    <p>
      As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases. This means
      that if you click on one of our product links and make a purchase, we
      may receive a small commission at no additional cost to you.
    </p>
    <p>
      We may also display advertising served by Google AdSense and participate
      in other affiliate or advertising programs from time to time.
    </p>
    <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
    <p>
      Commissions never influence which products we choose to review or how we
      rate them. We only recommend products we believe offer genuine value
      based on our research. Prices and availability shown on this Site are
      accurate as of the date of publishing and are subject to change on the
      retailer's site.
    </p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this disclosure, email
      <a href="mailto:hello@pickloot.com">hello@pickloot.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
